    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár kuungá' bar baraá tla/ángw xoordudá' i dir'á', kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng nu i diyaá/, nee bar kaangwí sleémeero naa sláy, tsuuqaaká' nee lo'ooro kiri insleeré', kuká' laarí naa dír geerahúng i qaás as tawa tsawdiinda', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee barnaxes qoomaadae AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ugwa i ki/é', kuungá' nee na/iihúng, axweesantós tidá' laarí naa oó' kari iialooeesé' ar munerhúng sleémeero nee qeeremoohúng sleémeero, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daqaní AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwók uri ki/is baraá amohhooarók, nee guruuwós iri tláy as kuúng, nee uri ki/is baraá xoorduudá' uy diyaa/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam geera kuungá' tunda diyaa/i baraá ku/uyaá yaamu awa saawá', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nun burumbuúr nuri ki/is. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nuri huuw baraá yaamuudá' baabi'iihúng naa aaliyé' as kuungá' kiwa ala'. Inós kuungá' nu amohhooárí haniis, nee nuri tlahhas baabi'iihúng ba/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kuungá' nee na/iihúng nu ilaiwa/ameérí haniis as inós kuwa sla'a' ar munerhúng sleémeero nee qeeremoohúng sleémeero as tawa slafa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng lo'oorí sleémeero gan amór wakuuserhúng xu'us, tidá' kuungá' nu slahh'eemiis, as inooín ngiwa /ak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' afór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kari malé ilaiwawa/á' nee hara'ayaarós sleémeero, tí laarí ni kuungií hara'ayiyiim kari otá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kuungá' nu diihhooár yaariír i haniis baraá umuú gár ta tlehhita'a, na/aá yaariir i laqwalá', nee hikwaá yaariir i sleerá', nee qamuuhúng balángw yaariír ngu hamaareesiyá'. Asma Mungú in malé qwalaa/ kuungá' nuwa dihhooárí haniisi, ar adoodá' ira qwalaá/ baabi'iihúng giri dihhooárí haniís, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "barnaxes kuungá' afór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng aga iiárií qasé', hara'ayaarós nee dabeerose kari oté', tidá' taa gooín baraá kitaábuuwuú dabe, nee barnaxes kuungá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ugwa i ki/é' ar munerhúng sleémeero, nee qeeremoohúng sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Looeemaawo hara'ayaarí laarí ni kuungií hara'ayiyiím ka ló'wa gawdeeká, slám ka saaweeká dirhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gawaá doorí diri'ká tam kuungá' tay oa', ‹Heé gawaá doorí tsa/ám as atén a heemá, as kahhó' ngiwa amoorén i huwi, as atén kawa axasaan nee kawa iialooeesaan?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laqaá sleeme i gayuú tláwtí diri'ká, tam kuungá' tari oa', ‹Heé waaraáhh ay gayuquú tlawi as atén a heemá, as kahhó' ngiwa amoorén i huwi, as atén kawa axasaan nee kawa iialooeesaan.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aasla'áy, ala /aymu ku ló'wa dirhúng i tseéw, i gawaá aferhúng nee i baraá munerhúng, as kuungá' kuwa boo/esa'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ga/aaweek laarí aníng slafiingw nee gwa'ara nee diihhooa nee amotlakweero ngaa dír geerawók i qaás as tawa tsawdiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwók aga ilaiwá/, tidá' laarí ni kuúng babaw, kuúng AAKO MUNGÚ Munguúwók kuri slá', loohirós kari eehát, kaahirós kari ót, nee dabeerose, nee hara'ayarose, kuúng daqaní a hót tari doogiín. Nee AAKO MUNGÚ, Munguúwók, kuúng turi tsuuq baraá yaamuudá' tay hotaá eer as kiwa al. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes kuungá' munerhúng aa warqeér tari iiawaslesé', tunduri afa /aásl munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmisuú eera', nee kiwa sagadiyusa', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aníng kuungá' nun baw tundu hhaamiis. Kuungá' a tleeresa'aaká baraá yaamuudá' ta aalír eera' amór gayuú yaaér Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng laarí doori nee yaamu i ateét tawa lamabu'uuse adór aníng slafiingw nee gwa'araro, nee tsuuqa nee lo'ooro ngira dír geeraahúng i qaás tawa tsawdiinda'. Gimsé' slafiingw tsawaraak, kuungá' nee na/iihunge, as tawa hota'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng sla'aak, nee afoorós iialooeesaak, nee inós i naga'ataak. Asma adoorí bara tlehhé' an slafingwhúng nee an hotaahúng awa tleerá' baraá yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa haniisi dír baabi'iihúng Abrahamu, nee Isaka nee Yakobo.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
